--- !u!114 &1193518026
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1193518025}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f125aa5cefa03f14a97c54ab3199049e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  dialoguePlayer: {fileID: 2058258601}
  combat: {fileID: 460468683}
  demon: {fileID: 1538478083}
  moon:
  - '!<NAME>!: It''s over for you, Magnus.'
  - '!<NAME>!: We have the Power of Moon on our side.'
  - 'Magnus: Huh. You visited Raggenfall, I presume.'
  - 'Magnus: That treacherous demon that I have to call my brother gave it to you?'
  - 'Magnus: That means one of you will not leave this place.'
  - 'Magnus: Or even better... Both of you will die in here!'
  - 'Magnus: You will not use that power on me!'
  moonPostFight:
  - 'Magnus: Ugh... You beat me...'
  - 'Magnus: But it''s not over yet, humans! You will not leave this place alive!'
  - '!<NAME>!: Ponter! It''s time! Leave this place now, or you''ll die with me!'
  - 'Ponter: Does it have to be this way? Is there really no other option?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Ponter! There is no time for this! I can already feel the seal charging
    up!'
  - '!<NAME>!: It''s going to blow up any moment! Now go! You have to rule our kingdom! '
  - 'Ponter: I''m going to miss you. '
  - 'Ponter: I''ll never forget you.'
  - 'Ponter: I love you, brother.'
  - '!<NAME>!: I love you too.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Thank you for everything, Ponter.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Now go!'
  demonMoon:
  - '!<NAME>!: There is no point in fighting, Magnus. You''ve already lost. Don''t
    even bother trying.'
  - 'Magnus: Oh yes? What makes you so sure, human?'
  - 'Ponter: We''ve brought someone that will keep you company while waiting for
    your ultimate demise!'
  - '!<NAME>!: It''s your brother! Brighten up!'
  - 'Magnus: What?!'
  demonMoonPost:
  - 'Demon: What is happening?! Stop this madness!'
  - '!<NAME>!: This will keep you in place! You''re not allowed to leave the waiting
    room!'
  - 'Magnus: You? Why you?! How did they manage to capture you?!'
  - 'Demon: He suprised me! He''s way stronger than I expected!'
  - 'Magnus: Take him away from me! Don''t let him use his power!'
  - '!<NAME>!: Oh, you must not understand what''s happening. He is our wild card.'
  - 'Demon: You won''t make me activate the seal!'
  - '!<NAME>!: Oh you won''t have to do this yourself. I will.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Alright, it''s time!'
  - '!<NAME>!: Let''s leave this place, Ponter!'
  - 'Ponter: After you, brother!'
  posessedMoon:
  - 'Magnus: You''re a demon like me. Why fight your own brother?'
  - '!<NAME>!: You''ve made enemies with your ruthless actions. Some of your brothers
    want you gone entirely.'
  - '!<NAME>!: And I will be the executioner. Now die!'
  posessedPost:
  - 'Magnus: You beat me... But you know you can''t kill me.'
  - '!<NAME>!: I had to weaken you first, which is something I''ve already accomplished.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Your brother will take over, and you''ll watch his power from hell.'
  - '!<NAME>!: It''s over.'
  player: {fileID: 1178238032}
  ponter: {fileID: 139592470}
  magnus: {fileID: 751190706}
  flashScreen: {fileID: 378471390}
  seal: {fileID: 476088084}
  demonSeal: {fileID: 1369343232}
  cameraShake: {fileID: 751190705}
  blackoutManager: {fileID: 1772730556}
  glassBox: {fileID: 334292692}
